# Spec: test map

## Default gate (`pnpm test:run`)

`scripts/run-vitest-stable.mjs` + `vitest.config.ts` projects:

- packages/shared, db, adapter-utils
- adapters: claude, codex, cursor, gemini, opencode, pi
- server (general then serialized route/authz files)
- cli

This is what `pr-verify.yml` would run **if** PRs targeted `master`.

## On disk but not in the default gate

| Area | Approx files | How to run |
|---|---|---|
| `apps/landing` | 60 | no package script; not in vitest projects |
| `workers/api` | 2 | not in root projects |
| Playwright e2e | 3 | `pnpm test:e2e` (workflow_dispatch only) |
| Release smoke | 1 | `pnpm test:release-smoke` (not called from release.yml) |
| Plugin examples | few | local vitest in those packages |

